%% Argus work_requests.status state machine
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  [*] --> REQUESTED : ENGINEER, POST /work-requests (201)

  REQUESTED --> RUNNING : POST /work-requests/:id/agent-runs (202), agent_runs 생성

  state RUNNING {
    direction LR
    [*] --> ALL_PENDING
    ALL_PENDING --> SPEC_DONE : step SPEC DONE
    SPEC_DONE --> LEGAL_DONE : step LEGAL DONE
    LEGAL_DONE --> SAFETY_DOC_DONE : step SAFETY_DOC DONE
    SAFETY_DOC_DONE --> VENDOR_DONE : step VENDOR DONE
    VENDOR_DONE --> [*]
  }
  note right of RUNNING
    agent_runs.overall_status = RUNNING
    step.status = PENDING | RUNNING | DONE | FAILED
    Mock: GET /agent-runs/:runId 호출마다 step 1개 DONE
    step FAILED 시 overall_status = FAILED, 재실행은 새 run_id
  end note

  RUNNING --> REVIEW : 4 step 모두 DONE, overall_status = REVIEW

  REVIEW --> PENDING_APPROVAL : ENGINEER, PATCH submit-approval (200)
  REVIEW --> REVIEW : submit-approval 422 (누락 정보) 또는 409 (run 미완료)

  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : SAFETY_MANAGER, POST approvals decision=APPROVE (201)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> PENDING_APPROVAL : APPROVE 인데 checklist 미완료 (409)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : decision=REJECT (201)
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REVIEW : decision=REQUEST_INFO (201), 코멘트 전달

  REJECTED --> RUNNING : 요청 수정 후 재실행, POST agent-runs (202)
  APPROVED --> DONE : 발주, 작업, 완료 보고 (ENGINEER / BUYER)

  APPROVED --> APPROVED : POST agent-runs 409 (재실행 불가)
  DONE --> DONE : POST agent-runs 409 (재실행 불가)
  DONE --> [*]

  note left of PENDING_APPROVAL
    Human-in-the-loop, 승인 주체 = SAFETY_MANAGER
    approvals.checklist 4항목 모두 true 필요:
    WORK_PERMIT, RISK_ASSESSMENT,
    LOTO_GAS_ISOLATION, GAS_DETECTOR_CHECK
  end note
